            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Airborne 0.3.12

- The trend map draws every state as flat land, like a weather map: no terrain or shading shows through the colors, and city labels sit on top.
- States with too few wastewater sites now have a clearly dashed border.
- Turning a layer off removes its colors and its legend entries, so the map and legend only show what's selected.
- Wastewater level colors are stronger in dark mode.
]]></description>
